== ask_user: an elicitation form
notify: prigh asks: 1. Storage
2. Anything else?
select: Which database? (optional)
  Postgres: what prod uses
  SQLite
  -> Postgres: what prod uses
input: Or your own answer (optional):  [default ""] -> ""
input: Anything else? (optional):  [default ""] -> "nothing"
select: 1. Storage
        2. Anything else?
          q1: Postgres
          q1_other: (empty)
          q2: nothing
  Submit
  Edit again
  Decline
  Cancel
  -> Submit
